## 0. Verdict

Status: done on the worktree. Merge is residual.

A Language Server Protocol (LSP) server is the editor helper that
`ooda lsp` starts. Completion is the name list that the editor asks
for. `--exec` means run the pinned program. Bench times a real
compiler check. TimeCap is the clock token.

One product `bin/ooda` on `wip/cli-three` does all three jobs.
The dirty parent still has the old lies. Do not copy onto it yet.

